Package: kae-driver
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kmod, initramfs-tools
Conflicts: libwd
Description: Kunpeng accelerator kernel modules and UADK libraries
 Precompiled uacce, hisi_qm, hisi_sec2, hisi_hpre and hisi_zip modules,
 UADK libraries, driver plugins and development headers.
 This build requires the exact running kernel ${kae:KernelRelease}.
 Installation verifies both module lookup paths and loaded module identities.

Package: kae-openssl
Architecture: arm64
Depends: kae-driver (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Kunpeng accelerator engine for OpenSSL 3.0
 KAE ENGINE extension for the system OpenSSL 3.0 library. Applications
 explicitly select the kae engine; the system OpenSSL configuration is
 not changed by this package.

Package: kae-zip
Architecture: arm64
Depends: kae-driver (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Kunpeng accelerated compression libraries and tools
 KAE implementations of zlib, gzip, zstd, lz4 and snappy, with their
 development headers and libraries. Accelerated compression libraries
 are installed in a private directory, alongside the system libraries.
